        "Description": "Use the DJ booth start location,poison the DJ in the back, eliminate the second one with the pistol, hide the bodies, go up the ladder,go on the vents, shoot the camera (if the 2 guys turn back, just drop behind the corner and crouch run through the door).Then, go and sneak to the music thing and turn it on.After you hear the &quot;Hey!&quot; in the song, it&apos;ll distract the target.Kill it,then hide it. After that, the other guys in the room&apos;ll leave,and if you run the others won&apos;t detect u. Now escape! :)",
